    reg {
        name = "EPLL configuration register 0";
        desc = "PERI_CRG8 is EPLL configuration register 0.

EPLL. FOUTVCO = 24 MHz x (fbdiv + frac/2^24) / refdiv (must be > 600 MHz and <= 1.6 GHz); FOUTPOSTDIV = FOUTVCO / (postdiv1 x postdiv2); FOUT1ph0/2/3/4 = FOUTVCO / (postdiv1 x postdiv2 x 2/4/6/8). In the power-down fields 0 = power down / no output and 1 = normal. Reset (Total Reset Value 0x1B000000 / 0x007C40E1): postdiv2 = 3, postdiv1 = 3, refdiv = 4, fbdiv = 225 -> VCO 1350 MHz, POSTDIV output 150 MHz. Derived clocks (Table 3-3): VCO/2 = 675 MHz (SIO MCLK source), VCO/6 = 225 MHz (VEDU, JPGE, VAPU/IVE), VCO/12 = 112.5 MHz (SFC), 54 MHz (VDP SD), 27 MHz (sensor clock), POSTDIV/3 = 50 MHz (SDIO, ETH RMII). The printed bit row of PERI_CRG8 (0x0B000000) disagrees with the header in bit 28; the header is used.

